The fuel prices, stations, official prices and forecasts come from the public
pages of Carbu.com (https://carbu.com), run by Fuel Media Service. The
integration reads them as a visitor would, about once an hour, and the widgets
show the source (Carbu.com) and the time of each reading. The files under
test/fixtures are reduced copies of these pages, kept only to test the reading
of their layout.

The way the station lists and the forecasts of Carbu.com are read was learnt
from the Home Assistant integrations carbu_com (myTselection) and carbu-hass
(Michel Heusschen, MIT licence); no code was copied.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
Carbu.com or Fuel Media Service.
